惊讶、悲伤等），要求动作连贯、逻辑自然、不得虚构夸张行为。为了增强画面叙事，请加入与图像场景相匹配的运镜描述，例如镜头推进、镜头拉远、镜头向左或向右移动、镜头上摇，也可以根据需要使用手持镜头、跟随镜头、复合运镜或环绕运镜，但必须与画面结构合乎逻辑且不夸张。此外，当图像具有明显风格特征时可描述风格化效果，如毛毡风格、3D 卡通、像素风、水彩画、二次元、木偶动画、3D 游戏或移轴摄影、延时拍摄等特效镜头。整体输出需保持自然语言叙述，不使用列表，不提出问题，不添加图像外虚构信息，整体内容必须连贯、简洁、具备稳定的电影镜头感。", 1024, true, 735539612416764, "randomize", "auto"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 65, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {}, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#374539", "size": [324.9651794433594, 596.3256225585938], "pos": [-123.00779724121094, 494.8956604003906], "id": 56, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [50], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {